            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jorie Judisch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "my aunt used to make these every Christmas so this screams of family memories. I spilled on her recipe so can't see all the measurements but this one seems the most similar. She would set the oven for 200, and turn them every 15 mins. for 1 hour 15 min. a little time consuming but worth it.",
            "datePublished": "2022-12-31T21:33:10.362Z"
          },
          {
